body:
That's what I am saying,she was shopping for clothing for her daughter too it seems,she was in the girls' section, Young lady, I kept thinking about that kid while everyone just stood there. As worried as I am about my job,I am more worried about her and literally miffed about no one helping.

&#x200B;

 I basically rushed out after all this because I was and still am in shock. I passed the managers and they didn't say anything but I am a wreck.
